{"h":11508,"lines":[{"conf":1,"x":0.10191075664828685,"w":0.81523895263671875,"h":0.026152569150167837,"text":"himself intercedes for us with sighs too deep for words. And","y":0.92765592379334449},{"w":0.81516171740247056,"text":"he who searches the hearts of men knows what is the mind","y":0.9089819259132591,"x":0.1019198730597289,"h":0.022209701083955369,"conf":1},{"h":0.027069411580524783,"text":"of the Spirit, because the Spirit intercedes for the saints","conf":1,"x":0.10187388015003024,"y":0.88230141196333312,"w":0.81763874400745729},{"x":0.10165244001695929,"text":"according to the will of God.\"","conf":1,"y":0.86013916728063178,"w":0.414434358671114,"h":0.025193619349646257},{"w":0.78414064877993095,"text":"We are not what we in our present state appear to be but","y":0.83874656040197149,"h":0.023481013282896979,"x":0.1352642179295028,"conf":1},{"x":0.10194264626293459,"w":0.81749150660130898,"y":0.81524316333051206,"h":0.025096115611848435,"text":"what we hope to be, and this we truly are if we hope for","conf":1},{"text":"what God in His love designs with us.","y":0.79505814001147013,"conf":1,"w":0.51306409959669241,"x":0.10213778906151126,"h":0.018929955505189389},{"h":0.023313492063491981,"text":"\"Darum zur Ruh, mein wild Gemüt!","y":0.76016865098700714,"x":0.22565321273919406,"w":0.51543941745510347,"conf":1},{"w":0.54869357022372156,"text":"Nicht alles wird hier Frucht, was blüht;","x":0.24465558469811563,"h":0.021831164284358051,"y":0.7383432540346615,"conf":1},{"text":"Du trägst, der Erde stummer Gast,","x":0.24703088325034517,"y":0.71502976176285715,"w":0.47743467851118604,"h":0.021888842658391083,"conf":1},{"x":0.24228028905532625,"w":0.46080760212687699,"conf":1,"y":0.69320436552648146,"h":0.020458424848223467,"text":"in dir, was nur der Himmel fasst."},{"y":0.672867063079852,"conf":1,"x":0.24465559239909621,"h":0.01909722222222221,"text":"Was für und für so ruhelos","w":0.3657957052255606},{"conf":1,"y":0.64825581446804437,"x":0.24703089972659431,"w":0.51306409959669241,"h":0.021883074253324475,"text":"dich dunkel treibt auf deinen Wegen,"},{"h":0.020371908233279279,"conf":1,"text":"Es ist das erste Flügelregen","x":0.24703087870730212,"y":0.62645348878642459,"w":0.36579572999632204},{"text":"des Falters in der Puppe Schoss;","conf":1,"y":0.60465116323458057,"h":0.01889534791310632,"w":0.44418052574256794,"x":0.24465557480686337},{"h":0.015988372621082103,"y":0.58575581360770024,"x":0.24703087808040669,"w":0.51068883127980413,"text":"Dir selbst bewusst kaum ist dein Leid","conf":1},{"text":"ein Heimweh nach der Ewigkeit.\"1","conf":1,"x":0.24465558915319424,"w":0.48218526468648543,"y":0.55952380916630395,"h":0.020418050743284732},{"h":0.013081395436846943,"conf":1,"y":0.53633720921471606,"text":"1 Geibel:","x":0.12589073515319485,"w":0.099762470691235033},{"y":0.51884920593239803,"w":0.51781473531351463,"h":0.017609126984126977,"x":0.24703087092485118,"conf":1,"text":"\"Hence calm yourself, my wild tormented heart!"},{"text":"Not all that blossoms here bears fruit;","conf":1,"x":0.26365796340980946,"y":0.50436046490675546,"w":0.4014251758525898,"h":0.015988372621082103},{"text":"Dumb guest of earth, you carry within you","w":0.45368169809316666,"y":0.48982558120399389,"conf":1,"x":0.2636579678417777,"h":0.015988372621082103},{"y":0.47786082764199989,"h":0.013521566750511305,"w":0.29978952779398338,"x":0.27052938877789656,"text":"What only heaven can grasp.","conf":1},{"y":0.46651785721946548,"x":0.27078385507857383,"w":0.40380046894023947,"h":0.010226328694631248,"conf":1,"text":"What drives vou on and on so restlessly"},{"w":0.19477434282178996,"x":0.26365795792402191,"y":0.44912790711409378,"text":"In your dark ways","conf":1,"h":0.014534883082859107},{"w":0.38004748852222003,"h":0.013150609201855179,"conf":1,"text":"Is the first stirring of butterfly wings","y":0.43452380940319624,"x":0.26365796215219173},{"h":0.011627906844729363,"text":"In the breast of the chrysalis;","conf":1,"y":0.42151162792453445,"x":0.26365795555398597,"w":0.30878859680968451},{"conf":1,"text":"All unknown to you, your pain","y":0.40550595238539699,"w":0.32541567319399356,"x":0.2660332614631773,"h":0.014632936507936511},{"conf":1,"y":0.38953488423848825,"h":0.017459163590083038,"text":"Is your yearning for eternity, your heart's home.\"","x":0.26365795736153019,"w":0.52731590766411318},{"conf":1,"x":0.49168646193276555,"y":0.075581394924924106,"w":0.035629452048958066,"h":0.015988372621082103,"text":"82"}],"page":78,"w":7029}